                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The summary line replaces \"Keep your effects, tempo and pedal setup.\" while Ed's setup is chosen. Open questions for the owner (the plan on #1513): racks within the 96 kHz effects budget, an Octaver footswitch, and whether track names stay shared by every session."
              }
